WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.637 --> 00:00:04.238
THEY HAVE FILED AN OPPOSITION TO

00:00:04.239 --> 00:00:05.306
DISMISS THAT ACCUSATION.

00:00:05.307 --> 00:00:07.275
&gt;&gt; Laura: HERE NOW TO BRUCE

00:00:07.276 --> 00:00:07.975
FONDA'S HARVARD LAW PROFESSOR

00:00:07.976 --> 00:00:13.614
AND OFFER OF THE INTRODUCTION TO

00:00:13.615 --> 00:00:14.382
THE UNPUBLISHED MUELLER REPORT.

00:00:14.383 --> 00:00:15.950
GOOD TO SEE YOU TONIGHT.

00:00:15.951 --> 00:00:17.018
WHY NOT FIGHT THIS OUT IN COURT

00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:20.288
IN AN EFFORT TO CLEAR YOUR NAME?

00:00:20.289 --> 00:00:21.923
&gt;&gt; WELL, I AM GOING TO.

00:00:21.924 --> 00:00:23.791
I HAVE TO DO TWO THINGS.

00:00:23.792 --> 00:00:24.425
I HAVE TO DEFEND THE

00:00:24.426 --> 00:00:26.627
FIRST AMENDMENT RIGHT OF EVERY

00:00:26.628 --> 00:00:27.862
AMERICAN TO RESPOND TO FALSE

00:00:27.863 --> 00:00:29.897
CHARGES, AND SECOND, IF THE CASE

00:00:29.898 --> 00:00:33.501
DOES GO TO COURT, TO SHOW THAT

00:00:33.502 --> 00:00:35.002
SHE IS A LIAR.

00:00:35.003 --> 00:00:37.872
LET ME REPEAT CATEGORICALLY, SHE

00:00:37.873 --> 00:00:38.873
MADE UP THE WHOLE STORY.

00:00:38.874 --> 00:00:41.275
I NEVER MET THIS WOMAN, IT WAS

00:00:41.276 --> 00:00:41.976
PART OF AN EXTORTION PLOT TO

00:00:41.977 --> 00:00:46.481
OBTAIN A BILLION DOLLARS FROM A

00:00:46.482 --> 00:00:48.683
BUSINESSMAN, THE MAN WHO OWNS A

00:00:48.684 --> 00:00:49.450
VICTORIA'S SECRET.

00:00:49.451 --> 00:00:51.085
HER OWN LAWYER ADMITTED TO ME ON

00:00:51.086 --> 00:00:52.119
TAPE THAT IT WOULD BE IMPOSSIBLE

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.822
FOR ME TO HAVE BEEN IN THE

00:00:54.823 --> 00:00:56.557
VARIOUS LOCATIONS AT THOSE TIMES

00:00:56.558 --> 00:00:59.727
AND THAT HIS CLIENT IS "WRONG.

00:00:59.728 --> 00:01:00.928
HE SIMPLY WRONG."

00:01:00.929 --> 00:01:02.129
I COMMISSIONED AN INVESTIGATION

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:04.532
FROM THE FORMER HEAD OF THE FBI

00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:05.566
WHO CONCLUDED THAT SHE WAS

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:05.867
WRONG.

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:09.237
HER OWN LAWYERS WITHDREW THE

00:01:09.238 --> 00:01:11.372
CHARGES IT SAYING IT A MISTAKE

00:01:11.373 --> 00:01:15.209
TO DO SO.

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:15.943
THIS SAME WOMAN WHO ACCUSED ME

00:01:15.944 --> 00:01:19.146
ACCUSED BILL CLINTON AND AL GORE

00:01:19.147 --> 00:01:23.985
OF BEING ON JEFFREY EPSTEIN'S

00:01:23.986 --> 00:01:27.121
ISLAND, AND THE REPORTS OF THE

00:01:27.122 --> 00:01:27.622
SECRET SERVICE --

00:01:27.623 --> 00:01:28.723
&gt;&gt; Laura: BILL CLINTON DID GO

00:01:28.724 --> 00:01:29.490
TO THE ISLAND.

00:01:29.491 --> 00:01:31.726
&gt;&gt; NO, HE WAS NEVER ON THE

00:01:31.727 --> 00:01:32.059
ISLAND.

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:33.895
HE WAS NEVER ON THE ISLAND.

00:01:33.896 --> 00:01:34.662
HE WAS NEVER THERE.

00:01:34.663 --> 00:01:36.097
HE ISSUED A STATEMENT THE OTHER

00:01:36.098 --> 00:01:36.831
DAY SAYING HE WAS NEVER ON THE

00:01:36.832 --> 00:01:39.433
ISLAND AND SECRET SERVICE

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:40.301
CONFIRMED HE WAS NEVER ON THERE

00:01:40.302 --> 00:01:41.570
APPEARED TO BE

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:42.770
WHEN THERE ARE DISCREPANCIES.

00:01:42.771 --> 00:01:45.840
THERE WERE DISCREPANCIES ON

00:01:45.841 --> 00:01:47.875
OTHER MATTERS WITH BILL CLINTON.

00:01:47.876 --> 00:01:50.077
HE SAID HE WAS ONLY ON TWO

00:01:50.078 --> 00:01:52.046
FLIGHTS, FOUR, TURNS OUT THERE

00:01:52.047 --> 00:01:53.247
WERE SIX.

00:01:53.248 --> 00:01:53.948
MAINE, THE SECRET SERVICE WAS

00:01:53.949 --> 00:01:54.415
ALWAYS WITH HIM.

00:01:54.416 --> 00:01:56.083
IT TURNS OUT THEY WEREN'T ALWAYS

00:01:56.084 --> 00:01:56.450
WITH HIM.

00:01:56.451 --> 00:01:59.220
I WOULDN'T THROW YOURSELF INTO A

00:01:59.221 --> 00:02:02.256
BILL CLINTON ON THIS NECESSARIL

00:02:02.257 --> 00:02:02.657
NECESSARILY.

00:02:02.658 --> 00:02:04.025
&gt;&gt; LET'S TALK ABOUT AL GORE.

00:02:04.026 --> 00:02:07.828
SHE CLAIMS THAT AL GORE WERE ON

00:02:07.829 --> 00:02:08.429
THE ISLAND.

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:10.431
NOT ONLY DID THEY NOT KNOW

00:02:10.432 --> 00:02:11.198
JEFFREY EPSTEIN BUT GUESS WHO

00:02:11.199 --> 00:02:13.100
AL GORE'S LAWYER WAS?

00:02:13.101 --> 00:02:16.904
DAVID BOYCE, THE SAME LAWYER WHO

00:02:16.905 --> 00:02:21.742
CLAIMS THAT THIS WOMAN MADE

00:02:21.743 --> 00:02:23.711
THESE IMPROPER ALLEGATIONS.

00:02:23.712 --> 00:02:26.647
HE COULD'VE EASILY CALLED HIS

00:02:26.648 --> 00:02:27.882
CLIENT, AL GORE, AND SAID, WERE

00:02:27.883 --> 00:02:29.083
YOU EVER ON JEFFREY EPSTEIN'S

00:02:29.084 --> 00:02:29.417
ISLAND?

00:02:29.418 --> 00:02:31.252
AND HE WOULD'VE TOLD HER WHAT HE

00:02:31.253 --> 00:02:31.786
TOLD EVERYONE ELSE.

00:02:31.787 --> 00:02:32.053
NO.

00:02:32.054 --> 00:02:33.020
HE WAS NEVER ON THE ISLAND,

00:02:33.021 --> 00:02:34.922
DIDN'T KNOW ANYONE AT ALL.

00:02:34.923 --> 00:02:36.524
THE INTERESTING THING IS THAT

00:02:36.525 --> 00:02:37.258
EPSTEIN IS BEING PROSECUTED NOW

00:02:37.259 --> 00:02:39.460
AND THEY ARE NOT USING THIS

00:02:39.461 --> 00:02:39.827
WITNESS.

00:02:39.828 --> 00:02:41.462
THE FBI IN THE U.S. ATTORNEY'S

00:02:41.463 --> 00:02:42.430
OFFICE ARE NOT USING THIS

00:02:42.431 --> 00:02:42.763
WITNESS.

00:02:42.764 --> 00:02:43.631
&gt;&gt; Laura: DOES SHE HAVE THE

00:02:43.632 --> 00:02:46.033
SAME LAWYER?

00:02:46.034 --> 00:02:47.234
DOES SHE HAVE THAT SAME LAWYER

00:02:47.235 --> 00:02:51.505
THAT YOU SAID YOU HAVE ON TAPE?

00:02:51.506 --> 00:02:52.273
STILL REPRESENTING HER?

00:02:52.274 --> 00:02:53.140
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:53.141 --> 00:02:56.310
DAVID BOYCE, WHO HAS AT HIS LAW

00:02:56.311 --> 00:02:57.078
FIRM, ONE OF THE WORST ETHICAL

00:02:57.079 --> 00:02:58.913
RECORDS IN THE HISTORY OF THE

00:02:58.914 --> 00:02:59.947
UNITED STATES.

00:02:59.948 --> 00:03:01.415
THEY HAVE MORE ETHICAL CHARGES

00:03:01.416 --> 00:03:04.585
AGAINST THEM THAN ANY OTHER LAW

00:03:04.586 --> 00:03:04.885
FIRM.

00:03:04.886 --> 00:03:06.253
&gt;&gt; Laura: AT THE BIG LAW FIRM.

00:03:06.254 --> 00:03:06.355
&gt;&gt; Sean:

00:03:06.788 --> 00:03:09.423
BUT HE IS THE HEAD OF THE LAW

00:03:09.424 --> 00:03:09.724
FIRM.

00:03:09.725 --> 00:03:11.325
HE WAS CHARGED WITH UNETHICAL

00:03:11.326 --> 00:03:14.795
CONDUCT BY "THE NEW YORK TIMES,"

00:03:14.796 --> 00:03:15.730
IN THE WEINSTEIN CASE.

00:03:15.731 --> 00:03:18.899
HE WAS CHARGED WITH QUESTIONABLE

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:23.104
CONDUCT INDEED SARAH           I

00:03:23.105 --> 00:03:23.137
CONDUCT INDEED SARAH           N

00:03:23.138 --> 00:03:23.170
CONDUCT INDEED SARAH           T

00:03:23.171 --> 00:03:23.838
CONDUCT INDEED SARAH           E

00:03:23.839 --> 00:03:23.871
CONDUCT INDEED SARAH           C

00:03:23.872 --> 00:03:23.904
CONDUCT INDEED SARAH           S

00:03:23.905 --> 00:03:24.271
CONDUCT INDEED SARAH           .

00:03:24.272 --> 00:03:24.905
HE HAS ABSOLUTELY NO COURT

00:03:24.906 --> 00:03:26.507
ABILITY BUT IN THIS CASE HE

00:03:26.508 --> 00:03:27.241
KNOWS THE CLIENT MADE UP THE

00:03:27.242 --> 00:03:29.310
WHOLE STORY AND HE TOLD ME THAT.

00:03:29.311 --> 00:03:30.878
I HAVE IT ON TAPE BEARD ALL I

00:03:30.879 --> 00:03:33.581
DID WAS REPEAT BASICALLY ON TAPE

00:03:33.582 --> 00:03:35.316
WHAT HE HAD TOLD ME.

00:03:35.317 --> 00:03:36.784
&gt;&gt; Laura: THAT IS DECIMATING

00:03:36.785 --> 00:03:38.452
IF YOU HAVE.

00:03:38.453 --> 00:03:39.887
&gt;&gt; YES, AND IT WILL BE PLAYED IN

00:03:39.888 --> 00:03:40.187
COURT.

00:03:40.188 --> 00:03:41.422
&gt;&gt; Laura: IF YOU HAVE THAT ON

00:03:41.423 --> 00:03:42.823
TAPE, THAT IS BAD.

00:03:42.824 --> 00:03:47.628
JOURNALIST VICKI WARD MADE THIS

00:03:47.629 --> 00:03:52.667
COMMENT ABOUT -- TOLD ACOSTA YOU

00:03:52.668 --> 00:03:53.768
WOULD MAKE MINCEMEAT OUT OF THE

00:03:53.769 --> 00:03:54.068
WOMEN.

00:03:54.069 --> 00:03:57.471
LET'S LISTEN.

00:03:57.472 --> 00:04:00.408
&gt;&gt; THE LIGHT THAT THE

00:04:00.409 --> 00:04:01.909
"MIAMI HERALD" SHED ON THE

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:04.045
VICTIMS' STORIES THAT WERE

00:04:04.046 --> 00:04:05.479
INCREDIBLY POIGNANT AND

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:05.846
CREDIBLE.

00:04:05.847 --> 00:04:09.150
REMEMBER BACK IN 2008,

00:04:09.151 --> 00:04:12.620
ALAN DERSHOWITZ CHOSE ALEXANDER

00:04:12.621 --> 00:04:13.921
ACOSTA THAT HE WAS GOING TO MAKE

00:04:13.922 --> 00:04:17.658
MINCEMEAT OF THESE WOMEN.

00:04:17.659 --> 00:04:18.826
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?

00:04:18.827 --> 00:04:20.494
&gt;&gt; THERE IS NO TRUTH TO THAT AT

00:04:20.495 --> 00:04:20.761
ALL.

00:04:20.762 --> 00:04:23.264
I MET WITH ACOSTA ONLY WANTS THE

00:04:23.265 --> 00:04:26.634
GROUP OF LAWYERS.

00:04:26.635 --> 00:04:27.601
PROBABLY 50 LAWYERS AND FBI

00:04:27.602 --> 00:04:28.803
AGENTS, I'M SURE NOTES WOULD

00:04:28.804 --> 00:04:29.170
COME FROM.

00:04:29.171 --> 00:04:31.105
I NEVER SAID ANYTHING LIKE THAT.

00:04:31.106 --> 00:04:35.710
WHAT I DID SAY WAS THERE IS NO

00:04:35.711 --> 00:04:36.444
CREDIBLE EVIDENCE THAT EPSTEIN

00:04:36.445 --> 00:04:39.847
AT THAT TIME HAD TRANSPORTED ANY

00:04:39.848 --> 00:04:41.649
UNDERAGE WOMEN IN INTERSTATE

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:42.016
COMMERCE.

00:04:42.017 --> 00:04:43.250
AND THAT WAS REQUIRED.

00:04:43.251 --> 00:04:45.086
BY THE WAY, VIRGINIA ROBERTS WAS

00:04:45.087 --> 00:04:45.853
NOT UNDER AGE.

00:04:45.854 --> 00:04:47.722
THEY HAVE ALL ADMITTED NOW THAT

00:04:47.723 --> 00:04:48.422
SHE DIDN'T START WORKING FOR

00:04:48.423 --> 00:04:52.593
EPSTEIN UNTIL SHE WAS 17 YEARS

00:04:52.594 --> 00:04:53.260
OLD.

00:04:53.261 --> 00:04:53.994
AND THAT SHE DOESN'T EVEN CLAIM

00:04:53.995 --> 00:05:00.901
THAT SHE HAD SEX WITH HIM.

00:05:00.902 --> 00:05:01.669
NUMEROUS PEOPLE SHE HAS ADMITTED

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:06.607
TO HAVING SEX WITH UNTIL SHE WAS

00:05:06.608 --> 00:05:09.210
OVER AGE, SO SHE HAS LIED ABOUT

00:05:09.211 --> 00:05:09.844
EVERYTHING.

00:05:09.845 --> 00:05:11.312
IT'S YOUR JOB AS A DEFENSE

00:05:11.313 --> 00:05:12.513
ATTORNEY TO MAKE SURE THE

00:05:12.514 --> 00:05:13.247
EVIDENCE IS CREDIBLE EVIDENCE.

00:05:13.248 --> 00:05:14.014
&gt;&gt; Laura: I CAN'T BELIEVE I

00:05:14.015 --> 00:05:14.949
DON'T KNOW THE ANSWER TO THIS

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:18.819
QUESTION, DO YOU STILL REPRESENT

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:19.553
HIM AND WHEN DID YOU STOP

00:05:19.554 --> 00:05:21.455
REPRESENTING HIM?

00:05:21.456 --> 00:05:21.789
EPSTEIN?

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:22.623
&gt;&gt; I STOPPED REPRESENTING HIM

00:05:22.624 --> 00:05:26.093
WHEN THE DEAL WAS MADE AND I

00:05:26.094 --> 00:05:27.361
HAVEN'T SEEN HIM IN YEARS.

00:05:27.362 --> 00:05:28.529
HIS LAWYERS CALL ME AND ASKED ME

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.397
A QUESTION ABOUT THE DEAL, OF

00:05:30.398 --> 00:05:31.632
COURSE, AS A LAWYER I HAVE TO

00:05:31.633 --> 00:05:33.167
ANSWER THAT QUESTION.

00:05:33.168 --> 00:05:35.569
LOOK, I WAS INTRODUCED TO HIM BY

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:36.637
THE LADY ROTHSCHILD.

00:05:36.638 --> 00:05:38.405
THE PEOPLE HE HUNG OUT WITH AT

00:05:38.406 --> 00:05:43.611
THE TIME WERE THE PRESIDENT OF

00:05:43.612 --> 00:05:45.279
HARVARD, I RELATIONSHIP WITH HIM

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:45.713
WAS ACADEMIC.

00:05:45.714 --> 00:05:48.749
WE WENT TO CONFERENCES, WE HAD

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.084
SEMINARS IN HIS OFFICE.

00:05:50.085 --> 00:05:51.852
NONE OF US HAD ANY INKLING THAT

00:05:51.853 --> 00:05:53.220
HE HAD THIS OTHER LIFE.

00:05:53.221 --> 00:05:54.989
AS SOON AS WE LEARNED ABOUT IT,

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:56.724
OBVIOUSLY ALL OF US ENDED ANY

00:05:56.725 --> 00:05:59.493
KIND OF A SOCIAL RELATIONSHIP.

00:05:59.494 --> 00:06:01.462
I THEN BECAME HIS LAWYER, I AM

00:06:01.463 --> 00:06:03.097
PROUD OF THE FACT I REPRESENTED

00:06:03.098 --> 00:06:03.430
HIM.

00:06:03.431 --> 00:06:04.498
I REPRESENTED A LOT OF

00:06:04.499 --> 00:06:05.833
CONTROVERSIAL PEOPLE, AND WE GOT

00:06:05.834 --> 00:06:06.901
A DEAL.

00:06:06.902 --> 00:06:07.902
SOME PEOPLE CRITICIZE THE DEAL

00:06:07.903 --> 00:06:09.203
BUT YOU CAN'T CRITICIZE HIS

00:06:09.204 --> 00:06:09.904
DEFENSE ATTORNEY FOR TRYING TO

00:06:09.905 --> 00:06:13.407
GET THE BEST DEAL POSSIBLE.

00:06:13.408 --> 00:06:15.009
BUT I WANT TO CATEGORICALLY

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:17.011
STATE, I NEVER MET THIS WOMAN.

00:06:17.012 --> 00:06:18.179
SHE MADE IT UP COMPLETELY.

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:19.847
I WILL CONTINUE TO SAY THAT

00:06:19.848 --> 00:06:22.049
UNTIL THE DAY I DIE AND WHEN I

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:22.783
DIE, MY CHILDREN WILL CONTINUE

00:06:22.784 --> 00:06:23.150
TO SAY IT.

00:06:23.151 --> 00:06:27.621
IT IS A TOTAL, CATEGORICAL LIVE.

00:06:27.622 --> 00:06:30.992
&gt;&gt; Laura: WE APPRECIATE YOU

